## Frequently asked questions

### Can a professional services firm get recommended by ChatGPT or Copilot?

Yes. Nobody controls the outcome. Firms
 with named experts, specific service pages, consistent facts and accurate third-party listings give AI assistants more to find and cross-check. No one can guarantee a mention. Answers vary by assistant, prompt and user.

